@host = http://localhost:5001

# Enable weatherforecast for GET requests and weatherforecast_edit for POST.
# To enable both when starting the sample:
# dotnet run --project Engarde.SampleWebApi/Engarde.SampleWebApi.csproj -- --weatherforecast=true --weatherforecast_edit=true

### Minimal API: get five forecasts (flag: weatherforecast, enabled)
GET {{host}}/weatherforecast
Accept: application/json

### Controller: get five forecasts (flag: weatherforecast_new, disabled)
GET {{host}}/api/weatherforecast
Accept: application/json

### Controller: append weather summaries (flag: weatherforecast, enabled)
POST {{host}}/api/weatherforecast
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "Names" : [
    "Stormy",
    "Humid"
  ]
}

### Controller: overwrite weather summaries (flag: weatherforecast_edit, disabled)
POST {{host}}/api/weatherforecast
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "Names" : [
    "Stormy",
    "Humid"
  ],
  "Overwrite": true
}

###
